291
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,700
Yes, very much.

292
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:23,880
Good.

293
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:27,010
Wonderful. Meaningless pleasantries accomplished.

294
00:13:27,010 --> 00:13:28,710
Elizabeth, Leonard's bathroom time is coming up,

295
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:31,120
