299
00:13:38,590 --> 00:13:39,790
You and Sheldon

300
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:40,930
and Sheldon's friend,

301
00:13:40,930 --> 00:13:42,630
Dr. Plimpton, who you just met.

302
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,330
