345
00:15:31,470 --> 00:15:34,210
'cause, boy, I was up all night.

346
00:15:34,210 --> 00:15:35,770
Did you get a cold, too?

347
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:39,510
No, but I was awake all night.

348
00:15:41,310 --> 00:15:42,850
If you want,

349
