350
00:15:46,890 --> 00:15:47,890
She won't notice they're missing?

351
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:49,960
She doesn't know she takes them.

352
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,260
No, that's okay.

353
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:55,190
