354
00:15:55,190 --> 00:15:57,130
And again this morning.

355
00:15:57,130 --> 00:15:59,970
And... I didn't mind.

356
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:05,400
I was up last night.

357
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,310
I was up this morning.

358
00:16:07,310 --> 00:16:09,270
I didn't mind.

359
