371
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:45,510
It is if you love her and give her a name.

372
00:16:45,510 --> 00:16:49,050
Dr. Plimpton, I'd like you to meet my colleagues--

373
00:16:49,050 --> 00:16:50,720
Dr. Rajesh Koothrappali

374
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:52,780
And not-a-doctor Howard Wolowitz.

375
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:56,620
- I'm a big fan of your work. - Thank you.

376
00:16:56,620 --> 00:17:00,830
